{"year":"2023","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 95th Academy Awards ceremony took place on March 12, 2023, at the Dolby Theatre in Hollywood, hosted by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 78303, 'screen_type': person}\">Jimmy Kimmel</a> for the third time. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 545611, 'screen_type': movie}\">Everything Everywhere All at Once</a> (2022) was the big winner of the night, with seven awards, including Best Picture, Director, Actress, Supporting Actor and Supporting Actress. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 49046, 'screen_type': movie}\">Im Westen nichts Neues</a> (All Quiet on the Western Front, 2022) took home four statuettes, including Best International Feature Film, and <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 785084, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Whale</a> (2022) won two."},{"type":"block_special","title":"Records","description":"<a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1620, 'screen_type': person}\">Michelle Yeoh</a> became the first Asian person to win the Oscar for Best Actress and the second woman of color to win the category, after Halle Berry. <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 690, 'screen_type': person}\">Ke Huy Quan</a> was the first Vietnamese-born actor to win an Oscar."},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Best Picture","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":545611,"name":"Everything Everywhere All at Once","image_path":"/2dSZQGwijlXvMSyuGe0FSgrXnv0.jpg","director":"Daniel Scheinert, Daniel Kwan","winner":true,"backdrop_path":"/fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg"},{"type":"movie","id":49046,"name":"All Quiet on the Western Front","image_path":"/qmcKs0Aoft7MBdBoj1haZyPRgM2.jpg","director":"Edward Berger","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":76600,"name":"Avatar: The Way of Water","image_path":"/hm6nONQOgVpKmRK5YUX9EqfJ0NH.jpg","director":"James Cameron","winner":false},{"type":"movie","id":674324,"name":"The Banshees of Inisherin","image_path":"/rtJtaJ3ayYJ2PdwgZpEQyBETpyu.jpg","director":"